[ti:Poèmes Tayeb (olympia 80)]
[ar:Tayeb Abdelli]
[al:Ass-agi lliɣ]
[length:4:18]
[by:Rayane Kch]
[00:12.33] A baba d ubernus
[00:14.17] Di lqaɛa yettexnunus
[00:16.21] A baba d ubernus
[00:17.19] Yeɣli ɣer daxel umalus
[00:19.19] Tamuɣli-w s adrar tḍul
[00:21.46] Mmeslayeɣ d wul
[00:22.26] Yenna-d kra ur iyi-hwi
[00:24.57] Ḥusseɣ yettmeyyiz yesmuqul
[00:25.85] Ɣef taḍsa yeggul
[00:27.05] Muddeɣ-as lḥeqq ma yerwi
[00:29.21] Abernus yellan mellul
[00:30.57] Beddlen-as llun
[00:31.94] Ass-agi yuɣal d aqehwi
[00:33.64]
[00:38.31] Ay abernus amellal
[00:39.28] A mmi-s n leḥlal
[00:40.46] Teḥṣiḍ s ifassen i k-yeẓḍan
[00:42.89] Bab-ik rran-t d tisulal
[00:44.49] Deg wass mi ara d-ilal
[00:45.59] Ulac tareẓgi i t-yexḍan
[00:47.35] Isekked di lmeḥna i d-yemlal
[00:48.92] Yerna ur yuklal
[00:50.10] Yectaq iḍes ula deg wuḍan
[00:53.17] Aqli iman-iw di ttexmam
[00:55.03] Kullec d asemmam
[00:56.03] Wi ara d-yasen
[00:56.75] Ad iyi-wanes
[00:58.21] Ufiɣ amɣaṛ s weɛmam
[00:59.39] Ḥkiɣ-as s ttmam
[01:00.32] Ziɣ kullec di ddehn ines
[01:02.49] Yenna a mmi ilik d aḥmam
[01:04.03] Ssali lekmam
[01:05.03] Abernus nneɣ yexnunes
[01:06.25]
[01:10.70] Ḥekkun-iyi-d ɣer jeddi
[01:12.23] Mi ara d-iɛeddi am yizem s ubernus-is
[01:15.40] Sked anida ur yeddi
[01:16.56] Lebda d ibeddi
[01:17.64] Nnif yezga d amwanes-is
[01:19.40] Leɛmer i t-inuda umḥaddi
[01:20.59] Ur yessin zeddi
[01:21.68] Ur yugad ula ɣef llebs-is
[01:23.76] Ay abernus mellulen
[01:25.40] Ayɣer i k-beddlen
[01:26.50] Settun-k seg wansi i d-tekkiḍ
[01:29.09] Sekra n wid i k-isuylen
[01:30.87] Seg wid medlulen
[01:31.92] Yuɣal-d znad ubeckiḍ
[01:33.93] Walaɣ ṣṣifa-k ɛellen
[01:35.01] Ttrun-t-d wallen
[01:36.00] Cubaɣ-k am wakken terkiḍ
[01:37.34]
[01:42.12] Ha-t-a wul-iw yedduqqus
[01:43.06] Iman-is di lqus
[01:44.20] D amuḍin mebla lehlak
[01:46.23] Kra yettru yenna drus
[01:47.59] Yerfed ur ittrus
[01:48.62] Nniɣ-as bezzaf fell-ak
[01:50.26] I t-iɣaḍen d abernus
[01:51.45] Iɣlin deg umalus
[01:52.39] Isin ur ufin leslak
[01:55.04] Ma yella yegzem lḥess-iw
[01:56.81] Yumes ubernus-iw
[01:57.81] Amek ara t-ssizedgeɣ
[01:59.76] Lemmer d ad tdum trusi-w
[02:02.68] Ad teṛṛeẓ tisi-w
[02:03.51] Inet-iyi-d anda ara cgeɣ
[02:05.45] D ayen ad icudd ufus-iw
[02:06.76] Ad yegzem lḥess-iw
[02:07.84] D acquf ara degdgeɣ
[02:11.00] Ay atma aqli-n mlelliɣ
[02:12.96] Ugadeɣ ad ɣliɣ
[02:13.93] Mačči d aṭṭan i uḍneɣ
[02:15.93] Deg wayen iɛeddan sliɣ
[02:17.00] Tura la ttwaliɣ
[02:18.00] Mi teẓṛa tiṭ-iw umneɣ
[02:20.62] D ayenni ṭṭeglelliɣ
[02:22.11] Deg yir taswiɛt i lliɣ
[02:23.46] Yumes ubernus nneɣ
[02:24.50]
[02:28.50] Ay abernus texnunseḍ
[02:29.81] Deg wanbuxen terseḍ
[02:31.68] Akkagi i k-ijerred
[02:34.93] Teḍṛa-d wul amzun yeṣṣeḍ
[02:36.46] Mi k-yeẓṛa tumseḍ
[02:37.65] Yesseṛzeg ula d ired
[02:39.52] Am ass-a ad tifsuseḍ
[02:40.78] Ṣbeṛ i wumi tḥussed
[02:41.71] S idammen ad k-nesired
[02:43.25]
[02:48.58] Nbedd s amɣaṛ nesla-as
[02:49.90] Yendeh yenna-as
[02:51.30] Dayen abernus amellal
[02:54.06] Llan mačči d dderya-s
[02:55.28] Umnen d tfetya-s
[02:57.03] Tedderɣel tiṭ ur n-uklal
[02:59.21] Ay atma ur gezzmet layas
[03:01.06] I nessarem ad-yas 
[03:02.05] Aggur am ass-a ad ilal
[03:04.06]
[03:50.84] A widak i d-iteddun
[03:52.24] Ma ad d-tecfum fehmet-iyi
[03:54.18] Iṛuḥ waffer ɣer umeṛɣun
[03:55.52] Yenna-as sens-iyi
[03:57.21] Ay atma-k ur k-ttlumun
[03:58.65] Nekk lhiɣ ssnen-iyi
[04:00.28] Ur tufiḍ ara d-yeḍrun
[04:01.80] Ur ttaggad amen-iyi
[04:03.62] Yumen umeṛɣun yessens-it
[04:04.99] Mi as d-yenna ɣef yiwen yiḍ kan
[04:06.99] Azekka-nni taṣebḥit yenna-as ṛuḥ d lawan
[04:10.06] Ziɣen affer iɣuṛṛ-it
[04:11.33] Yessaɣ-itt din d iḍeṛfan
[04:13.13] Yenna awal ṛwaḥ tlef-it
[04:14.52] Neɣ iyya ad neḥseb iẓuṛan
[04:16.54]